display_name = "Sarsaparilla Six"
role = "Gold Rush Gulch six-shooter loaded with soda-bottle rounds. Tap for an accurate shot about four times a second; hold the trigger and the off hand fans the hammer, emptying the cylinder in under a second while the spread climbs with every shot. The sixth round is the Last Call: it fizzes out with 60% more damage, a hard shove and a soda pop that splashes the zombies round the hit. Count your shots (the cylinder ring under the crosshair helps): six rounds and a speed-loader reload make it a burst sidearm, not a hose."
